    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d857">

                <pb facs="1059" n="963" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg963"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Day to Mr. Hay.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date
                            ana="#date_imprecise-inferred-from-document-content"
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1898-12-01T21:00:00+00:09"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">December 1, 1898</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 35.]</seg></opener>
                <p>At this time, Thursday, 8.30 p.m., we have received no answer to our telegram
                    asking for instruction as to Spanish rights in ports of Cuba and Puerto Rico and
                    concerning Kusaie. It is important to have same to-morrow.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-12-01T21:00:00+00:09">Thursday evening, 9</date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Day.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
